{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Do not classify discarded unknown fields as error details.** An unknown key counts as nonempty even when its value is `undefined`, but `fromErrorObject` ignores that field. Thus `{ FutureDetail: undefined }` fabricates an `Unknown error`, while a defined future field is discarded but still changes `error` from absent to present. Ignore unsupported fields when detecting details, or preserve their defined values, and assert the converted value in the test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs7-ERBn","finding_digest":"d94b13925de13f929bcde1771412a3892a8f913b2055c6e240c5aba5c0f3547b","finding_id":"arf_v1_3ffrhes54e7zfg6n4f3rievdre","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/utils/operation/operation.ts::tooperationinfo::unknown-error-detail-preservation","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/utils/operation/operation.ts::tooperationinfo::unknown-error-detail-preservation","line":47,"observation_digest":"808a996c5ea419a01ac1cca9090d8cd5d4d5ca8e8c24b68fc7e6e3056665a232","observation_id":"aro_v1_qcfjs3c6uqm2agwbzsuqsdmm2x","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/utils/operation/operation.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_3ffrhes54e7zfg6n4f3rievdre","published_at":"2026-10-13T18:33:42Z","review_id":"arr_v1_kzxp7vt5lvpz3ub6fqkp2wcw4s","reviewed_base_sha":"89011d8369d00ba0f6ddb49d850f73d1e864d96d","reviewed_head_sha":"60295b7375ffd570073dbfb6132c4b891af7d6a3","reviewer":"codex","start_line":43,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":960},"record_id":"art_v1_oxmbgfpq3ml2534svrjlbhu2ah","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T18:33:42Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
